  options: ["Bacteria in a biofilm are protected by the matrix and grow slowly, so they tolerate drug levels that kill free-floating cells","Periodontal bacteria are all intrinsically resistant to amoxicillin","Antibiotics cannot enter gingival crevicular fluid","Periodontitis is a viral disease"],
